{
  "book": "helaman",
  "bookName": "Helaman",
  "chapter": 13,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 676.85,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass in the eighty and sixth year, the Nephites did still remain in wickedness,",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "start": 7.053,
      "end": 8.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in great wickedness,",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 8.858,
      "end": 15.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while the Lamanites did observe strictly to keep the commandments of God, according to the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "13:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 16.365,
      "end": 18.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that in this year",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 18.681,
      "end": 23.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was one Samuel, a Lamanite, came into the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 23.737,
      "end": 26.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to preach unto the people.",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 26.564,
      "end": 31.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he did preach, many days, repentance unto the people,",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.76,
      "end": 33.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did cast him out,",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.751,
      "end": 36.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was about to return to his own land.",
      "verse": "13:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.171,
      "end": 40.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the voice of the Lord came unto him",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.323,
      "end": 42.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should return again,",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 42.407,
      "end": 44.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prophesy unto the people",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 44.63,
      "end": 47.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whatsoever things should come into his heart.",
      "verse": "13:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 48.004,
      "end": 53.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they would not suffer that he should enter into the city;",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.525,
      "end": 55.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he went",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.702,
      "end": 57.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and got upon the wall thereof,",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 57.972,
      "end": 60.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stretched forth his hand",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 60.242,
      "end": 62.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cried with a loud voice,",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 62.28,
      "end": 67.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prophesied unto the people whatsoever things the Lord put into his heart.",
      "verse": "13:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.79,
      "end": 69.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto them:",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 69.503,
      "end": 74.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I, Samuel, a Lamanite, do speak the words of the Lord",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 74.188,
      "end": 76.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he doth put into my heart;",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 76.783,
      "end": 81.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold he hath put it into my heart to say unto this people",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 81.189,
      "end": 84.3,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the sword of justice hangeth over this people;",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 84.48,
      "end": 86.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and four hundred years pass not away",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 87.121,
      "end": 90.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save the sword of justice falleth upon this people.",
      "verse": "13:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 91.005,
      "end": 93.977,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, heavy destruction awaiteth this people,",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 94.157,
      "end": 96.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it surely cometh unto this people,",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 96.938,
      "end": 99.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and nothing can save this people",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 99.44,
      "end": 103.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be repentance and faith on the Lord Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 103.242,
      "end": 105.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who surely shall come into the world,",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.837,
      "end": 107.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall suffer many things",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 108.06,
      "end": 109.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be slain for his people.",
      "verse": "13:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 110.644,
      "end": 114.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, an angel of the Lord hath declared it unto me,",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 114.4,
      "end": 116.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did bring glad tidings to my soul.",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 117.088,
      "end": 121.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I was sent unto you to declare it unto you also,",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 121.401,
      "end": 123.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye might have glad tidings;",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 123.903,
      "end": 126.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold ye would not receive me.",
      "verse": "13:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 126.905,
      "end": 133.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, thus saith the Lord: Because of the hardness of the hearts of the people of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 133.772,
      "end": 135.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they repent",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 135.577,
      "end": 137.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will take away my word from them,",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 137.986,
      "end": 140.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will withdraw my Spirit from them,",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 140.395,
      "end": 142.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will suffer them no longer,",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 142.665,
      "end": 146.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will turn the hearts of their brethren against them.",
      "verse": "13:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 147.246,
      "end": 149.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And four hundred years shall not pass away",
      "verse": "13:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 150.12,
      "end": 152.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "before I will cause that they shall be smitten;",
      "verse": "13:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 153.133,
      "end": 157.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I will visit them with the sword and with famine and with pestilence.",
      "verse": "13:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 158.411,
      "end": 160.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I will visit them in my fierce anger,",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 161.145,
      "end": 168.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be those of the fourth generation who shall live, of your enemies, to behold your utter destruction;",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 168.337,
      "end": 171.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this shall surely come except ye repent,",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 171.536,
      "end": 172.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord;",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 173.063,
      "end": 177.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those of the fourth generation shall visit your destruction.",
      "verse": "13:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 177.737,
      "end": 180.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But if ye will repent and return unto the Lord your God",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 181.075,
      "end": 182.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will turn away mine anger,",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 183.159,
      "end": 184.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord;",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 184.686,
      "end": 186.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, thus saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 186.538,
      "end": 189.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "blessed are they who will repent and turn unto me,",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 189.876,
      "end": 192.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but wo unto him that repenteth not.",
      "verse": "13:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 192.878,
      "end": 195.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wo unto this great city of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 195.705,
      "end": 200.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, it is because of those who are righteous that it is saved;",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 200.993,
      "end": 203.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, wo unto this great city,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 203.263,
      "end": 204.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I perceive,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 205.115,
      "end": 206.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 206.642,
      "end": 211.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there are many, yea, even the more part of this great city,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 211.327,
      "end": 213.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that will harden their hearts against me,",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 213.736,
      "end": 215.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "13:12",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 215.716,
      "end": 218.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But blessed are they who will repent,",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 218.311,
      "end": 220.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for them will I spare.",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 220.209,
      "end": 224.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, if it were not for the righteous who are in this great city,",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 224.987,
      "end": 230.049,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, I would cause that fire should come down out of heaven and destroy it.",
      "verse": "13:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 230.729,
      "end": 234.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, it is for the righteous' sake that it is spared.",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 234.346,
      "end": 236.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the time cometh,",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 236.523,
      "end": 237.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 238.05,
      "end": 241.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that when ye shall cast out the righteous from among you,",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 241.759,
      "end": 244.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then shall ye be ripe for destruction;",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 244.447,
      "end": 251.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, wo be unto this great city, because of the wickedness and abominations which are in her.",
      "verse": "13:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 252.0,
      "end": 254.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and wo be unto the city of Gideon,",
      "verse": "13:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 254.781,
      "end": 258.31,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the wickedness and abominations which are in her.",
      "verse": "13:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 258.99,
      "end": 263.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and wo be unto all the cities which are in the land round about,",
      "verse": "13:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 263.303,
      "end": 270.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are possessed by the Nephites, because of the wickedness and abominations which are in them.",
      "verse": "13:16",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 271.228,
      "end": 274.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, a curse shall come upon the land,",
      "verse": "13:17",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 274.984,
      "end": 276.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "13:17",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 276.789,
      "end": 279.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because of the people's sake who are upon the land,",
      "verse": "13:17",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 280.173,
      "end": 283.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, because of their wickedness and their abominations.",
      "verse": "13:17",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 284.011,
      "end": 285.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 286.095,
      "end": 287.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 287.9,
      "end": 289.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, our great and true God,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 290.17,
      "end": 293.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whoso shall hide up treasures in the earth",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 293.183,
      "end": 297.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall find them again no more, because of the great curse of the land,",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 297.914,
      "end": 301.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save he be a righteous man and shall hide it up unto the Lord.",
      "verse": "13:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 302.449,
      "end": 304.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I will, saith the Lord",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 304.487,
      "end": 307.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall hide up their treasures unto me;",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 307.918,
      "end": 312.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cursed be they who hide not up their treasures unto me;",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 312.231,
      "end": 316.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for none hideth up their treasures unto me save it be the righteous;",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 316.683,
      "end": 319.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he that hideth not up his treasures unto me,",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 320.114,
      "end": 322.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cursed is he, and also the treasure,",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 322.848,
      "end": 325.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none shall redeem it because of the curse of the land.",
      "verse": "13:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 326.639,
      "end": 330.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the day shall come that they shall hide up their treasures,",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 330.441,
      "end": 333.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they have set their hearts upon riches;",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 333.454,
      "end": 336.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because they have set their hearts upon their riches,",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 337.024,
      "end": 341.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will hide up their treasures when they shall flee before their enemies;",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 341.848,
      "end": 344.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they will not hide them up unto me,",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 344.489,
      "end": 347.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cursed be they and also their treasures;",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 347.363,
      "end": 350.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in that day shall they be smitten,",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 350.19,
      "end": 351.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord.",
      "verse": "13:20",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 352.17,
      "end": 354.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold ye, the people of this great city,",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 354.951,
      "end": 356.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hearken unto my words;",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 357.035,
      "end": 360.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, hearken unto the words which the Lord saith;",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 360.559,
      "end": 364.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, he saith that ye are cursed because of your riches,",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 364.779,
      "end": 367.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also are your riches cursed",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 367.281,
      "end": 369.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye have set your hearts upon them,",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 370.108,
      "end": 374.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have not hearkened unto the words of him who gave them unto you.",
      "verse": "13:21",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 375.525,
      "end": 377.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye do not remember the Lord your God",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 377.981,
      "end": 380.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the things with which he hath blessed you,",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 380.994,
      "end": 383.177,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but ye do always remember your riches,",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 383.357,
      "end": 385.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not to thank the Lord your God for them;",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 385.952,
      "end": 388.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, your hearts are not drawn out unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 389.151,
      "end": 392.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they do swell with great pride, unto boasting,",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 392.442,
      "end": 398.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto great swelling, envyings, strifes, malice, persecutions, and murders,",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 398.334,
      "end": 400.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of iniquities.",
      "verse": "13:22",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 401.011,
      "end": 408.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For this cause hath the Lord God caused that a curse should come upon the land, and also upon your riches,",
      "verse": "13:23",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 408.436,
      "end": 410.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of your iniquities.",
      "verse": "13:23",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 411.484,
      "end": 415.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wo unto this people, because of this time which has arrived,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 415.658,
      "end": 417.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye do cast out the prophets,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 418.021,
      "end": 419.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do mock them,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 419.687,
      "end": 421.545,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cast stones at them,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 421.725,
      "end": 423.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do slay them,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 423.345,
      "end": 426.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do all manner of iniquity unto them,",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 426.59,
      "end": 428.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as they did of old time.",
      "verse": "13:24",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 429.267,
      "end": 430.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when ye talk,",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 430.98,
      "end": 432.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye say:",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 432.275,
      "end": 435.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If our days had been in the days of our fathers of old,",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 435.659,
      "end": 437.749,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we would not have slain the prophets;",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 437.929,
      "end": 441.366,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we would not have stoned them, and cast them out.",
      "verse": "13:25",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 442.046,
      "end": 444.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold ye are worse than they;",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 444.269,
      "end": 447.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for as the Lord liveth, if a prophet come among you",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 447.421,
      "end": 450.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and declareth unto you the word of the Lord,",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 450.62,
      "end": 454.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which testifieth of your sins and iniquities,",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 454.283,
      "end": 456.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye are angry with him, and cast him out",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 456.831,
      "end": 459.617,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and seek all manner of ways to destroy him;",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 459.797,
      "end": 462.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, you will say that he is a false prophet,",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 462.949,
      "end": 465.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he is a sinner, and of the devil,",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 466.055,
      "end": 469.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because he testifieth that your deeds are evil.",
      "verse": "13:26",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 469.8,
      "end": 473.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, if a man shall come among you and shall say:",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 473.417,
      "end": 475.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do this, and there is no iniquity;",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 475.826,
      "end": 479.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do that and ye shall not suffer; yea, he will say:",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 479.535,
      "end": 481.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Walk after the pride of your own hearts;",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 482.13,
      "end": 484.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, walk after the pride of your eyes,",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 484.864,
      "end": 487.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do whatsoever your heart desireth\u2014",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 487.366,
      "end": 491.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if a man shall come among you and say this, ye will receive him,",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 492.051,
      "end": 493.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and say that he is a prophet.",
      "verse": "13:27",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 494.496,
      "end": 496.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, ye will lift him up,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 496.255,
      "end": 498.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye will give unto him of your substance;",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 499.175,
      "end": 502.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye will give unto him of your gold, and of your silver,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 502.745,
      "end": 505.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye will clothe him with costly apparel;",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 505.479,
      "end": 508.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because he speaketh flattering words unto you,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 508.91,
      "end": 510.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saith that all is well,",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 510.762,
      "end": 513.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then ye will not find fault with him.",
      "verse": "13:28",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 513.764,
      "end": 516.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye wicked and ye perverse generation;",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 516.638,
      "end": 519.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye hardened and ye stiffnecked people,",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 519.465,
      "end": 522.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how long will ye suppose that the Lord will suffer you?",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 522.524,
      "end": 527.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, how long will ye suffer yourselves to be led by foolish and blind guides?",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 527.673,
      "end": 531.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, how long will ye choose darkness rather than light?",
      "verse": "13:29",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 531.882,
      "end": 535.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, behold, the anger of the Lord is already kindled against you;",
      "verse": "13:30",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 535.731,
      "end": 539.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he hath cursed the land because of your iniquity.",
      "verse": "13:30",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 540.033,
      "end": 543.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the time cometh that he curseth your riches,",
      "verse": "13:31",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 543.696,
      "end": 545.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they become slippery,",
      "verse": "13:31",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 545.641,
      "end": 547.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye cannot hold them;",
      "verse": "13:31",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 547.539,
      "end": 551.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the days of your poverty ye cannot retain them.",
      "verse": "13:31",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 551.888,
      "end": 555.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in the days of your poverty ye shall cry unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 555.458,
      "end": 557.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in vain shall ye cry,",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 557.31,
      "end": 560.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for your desolation is already come upon you,",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 560.323,
      "end": 562.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your destruction is made sure;",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 562.732,
      "end": 565.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then shall ye weep and howl in that day,",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 565.838,
      "end": 567.603,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saith the Lord of Hosts.",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 567.783,
      "end": 570.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall ye lament, and say:",
      "verse": "13:32",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 570.831,
      "end": 572.549,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that I had repented,",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 572.729,
      "end": 574.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had not killed the prophets,",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 574.859,
      "end": 576.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stoned them,",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 576.339,
      "end": 577.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cast them out.",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 578.144,
      "end": 579.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, in that day ye shall say:",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 580.135,
      "end": 582.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that we had remembered the Lord our God",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 582.869,
      "end": 585.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the day that he gave us our riches,",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 585.835,
      "end": 588.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then they would not have become slippery",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 588.476,
      "end": 589.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we should lose them;",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 590.142,
      "end": 592.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, our riches are gone from us.",
      "verse": "13:33",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 593.19,
      "end": 596.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we lay a tool here and on the morrow it is gone;",
      "verse": "13:34",
      "lineIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "start": 596.667,
      "end": 599.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, our swords are taken from us",
      "verse": "13:34",
      "lineIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "start": 599.633,
      "end": 601.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the day we have sought them for battle.",
      "verse": "13:34",
      "lineIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "start": 602.31,
      "end": 604.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, we have hid up our treasures",
      "verse": "13:35",
      "lineIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "start": 604.812,
      "end": 609.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have slipped away from us, because of the curse of the land.",
      "verse": "13:35",
      "lineIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "start": 610.275,
      "end": 614.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O that we had repented in the day that the word of the Lord came unto us;",
      "verse": "13:36",
      "lineIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "start": 615.053,
      "end": 617.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold the land is cursed,",
      "verse": "13:36",
      "lineIndex": 196
    },
    {
      "start": 617.183,
      "end": 619.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things are become slippery,",
      "verse": "13:36",
      "lineIndex": 197
    },
    {
      "start": 619.406,
      "end": 621.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we cannot hold them.",
      "verse": "13:36",
      "lineIndex": 198
    },
    {
      "start": 621.944,
      "end": 624.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we are surrounded by demons,",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 199
    },
    {
      "start": 624.585,
      "end": 627.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we are encircled about by the angels of him",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 200
    },
    {
      "start": 628.016,
      "end": 630.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who hath sought to destroy our souls.",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 201
    },
    {
      "start": 630.472,
      "end": 632.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, our iniquities are great.",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 202
    },
    {
      "start": 632.881,
      "end": 633.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 203
    },
    {
      "start": 634.083,
      "end": 636.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "canst thou not turn away thine anger from us?",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 204
    },
    {
      "start": 637.142,
      "end": 639.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this shall be your language in those days.",
      "verse": "13:37",
      "lineIndex": 205
    },
    {
      "start": 640.562,
      "end": 643.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, your days of probation are past;",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 206
    },
    {
      "start": 643.389,
      "end": 646.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye have procrastinated the day of your salvation",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 207
    },
    {
      "start": 646.727,
      "end": 649.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until it is everlastingly too late,",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 208
    },
    {
      "start": 649.275,
      "end": 651.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your destruction is made sure;",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 209
    },
    {
      "start": 651.684,
      "end": 654.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, for ye have sought all the days of your lives",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 210
    },
    {
      "start": 654.697,
      "end": 657.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for that which ye could not obtain;",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 211
    },
    {
      "start": 657.199,
      "end": 660.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye have sought for happiness in doing iniquity,",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 212
    },
    {
      "start": 660.63,
      "end": 664.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thing is contrary to the nature of that righteousness",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 213
    },
    {
      "start": 664.247,
      "end": 666.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is in our great and Eternal Head.",
      "verse": "13:38",
      "lineIndex": 214
    },
    {
      "start": 667.342,
      "end": 670.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye people of the land, that ye would hear my words!",
      "verse": "13:39",
      "lineIndex": 215
    },
    {
      "start": 670.448,
      "end": 673.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I pray that the anger of the Lord be turned away from you,",
      "verse": "13:39",
      "lineIndex": 216
    },
    {
      "start": 673.647,
      "end": 676.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye would repent and be saved.",
      "verse": "13:39",
      "lineIndex": 217
    }
  ]
}